{"title":"Sum-to-product identities","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Here are the sum-to-product identities:\n</p>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/6/2d6a2b57e7db2d5d7c00d9435924399ff7225fc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin (x) + \\sin (y) =  2 \\sin \\left(\\frac{x + y}{2}\\right) \\cos \\left(\\frac{x - y}{2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"354\" height=\"45\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/4/d94476e5845b85a61dd24563232b7a4452ed1b71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin (x) - \\sin (y) =  2 \\sin \\left(\\frac{x - y}{2}\\right) \\cos \\left(\\frac{x + y}{2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"354\" height=\"45\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/f/dcfc52afe7a786228d24594822d21d954f4e2ea3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos (x) + \\cos (y) =  2 \\cos \\left(\\frac{x + y}{2}\\right) \\cos \\left(\\frac{x - y}{2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"360\" height=\"45\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/f/e5f53d4a9ca0228c3209104c81aadd9f9be7a9a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos (x) - \\cos (y) = -2 \\sin \\left(\\frac{x + y}{2}\\right) \\sin \\left(\\frac{x - y}{2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"370\" height=\"45\" /></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Sum-to-product_identities&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sum-to-product_identities&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Trigonometric_identities\" title=\"Trigonometric identities\">Trigonometric identities</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018015851\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 31/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 316/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1056/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.959      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.959      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:25198:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018015851 and revision id 197938. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}